{"overview":"Eight years ago, the youngest daughter, Gyeong-ju, disappeared during a school field trip to Gyeongju and never came home alive.  On what would have been her birthday, her mother Ok-sil and her three daughters—Jang-ju, Young-ju, and Dong-ju—put on matching family T-shirts and set off for Gyeongju, the place where Gyeong-ju vanished, in what appears to be a family trip to honor her memory. But beneath the cheerful façade lies a deadly secret. In the trunk of their van is a bound and unconscious man zipped inside a plastic bag.","tagline":"","overview_en":"","tagline_en":"We kidnapped a killer","runtime":111,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["김미조"],"crew_en":["Kim Mi-jo"],"countries":["KR"],"cast":[{"name":"لی جانگ-ایان","role":"Ok-sil","photo":"/4r3K47UpSmzZ5t9cyTRRqRl9rdz.jpg","en":"Lee Jung-eun"},{"name":"گونگ هیو جین","role":"Jang-ju","photo":"/u2ZDHJOHRkgzY0dpaORitoZjF4F.jpg","en":"Kong Hyo-jin"},{"name":"پارک سو دام","role":"Young-ju","photo":"/fGVOikpvivopeATDy6ZzLdKYXDu.jpg","en":"Park So-dam"},{"name":"이연","role":"Dong-ju","photo":"/uTZMewSjjx4MxDYAaZrhbl1fAGX.jpg","en":"Lee Yeon"},{"name":"변요한","role":"Baek Sang-hyun","photo":"/5kOBQYbgBTAf8nVzgx0ecCsJ1pW.jpg","en":"Byun Yo-han"},{"name":"황현정","role":"Gyeong-ju","photo":"/7bpJcgnnlNEky1DV7PG6NJjWnLw.jpg","en":"Hwang Hyun-jung"},{"name":"김학선","role":"Mu-il","photo":"/4SKruoQKCk3k0umArclsDftwuTM.jpg","en":"Kim Hak-sun"},{"name":"김영성","role":"Seok-man","photo":"/slqUy6zlmG4nhl3shaZzDsY91MA.jpg","en":"Kim Young-sung"},{"name":"김세아","role":"Yun-ji","photo":"/rKvFve8ZOPBpY9qNFAgxgHWM3oE.jpg","en":"Kim Se-ah"},{"name":"남권아","role":"Pil-rye","photo":"/3khEPr2t7Qnh3mnynkI4nPUmpG.jpg","en":"Nam Gwon-a"},{"name":"엄준기","role":"Jo-man","photo":"/iJMzw2DFvny6wUSPhHM6IkGDGZO.jpg","en":"Uhm Jun-ki"},{"name":"김대한","role":"Big Guy","photo":"/eMq2on2tsA0WwpJgyXwbljFtuKB.jpg","en":"Kim Dae-han"}],"trailer":"1na2T_TzFcg","watch":{},"recs":[],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1235769"}